{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4ebe001d2c85d006","name":"Heavy Dark Armor","source":{"id":"source:reference-4ebe001d2c85d006","title":"Heavy Dark Armor","revision":20433,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:50:25Z","sha256":"f410dc7395f054c459364a497d9c8c675462a4c47e0ac4436b7e594fbaa8dcc7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20433","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Heavy%20Dark%20Armor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4ebe001d2c85d006","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Dark Armor is the generic name given to various suits of armor possessed and worn by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". Each suit of Dark Armor is unique, having been created for and often modified by an individual ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lord","referenceId":"reference:099f599e53fbfc32"},". These suits of armor may look like they originated as other stock models, but they are modified through various process, including ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Advanced Alchemy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Advanced_Alchemy"}]},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Dark Armor is not just another piece of protective gear; to many ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"},", the armor is nearly as important as their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsabers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsabers","referenceId":"reference:420c60d0a682943a"},". A suit of Dark Armor defines a Sith Lord's appearance, and is frequently made to be as frightening as possible. A suit of Heavy Dark Armor automatically comes with a single enhancement from the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemy Specialist"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemy_Specialist"}]}," Talent, as defined in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Alchemy Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Alchemy_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:e965af2a898e4eec"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Armor","referenceId":"reference:4bc2d20a5687b54f"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 25,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},":"]}," +8\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},":"]}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Maximum ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," Bonus:"]}," +1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 30 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
